    • Calendar Config Requests: To approve/reject pending requests for users created by other users.




When the user clicks on Calendar Configuration two options are displayed: 
    • Calendar Configuration Tab: To create and modify the Calendar requests.
    • My Requests: To view the status of the Calendar requests raised by the users.

